Revision history for tir

{{$NEXT}}

v0.11 2026-10-28
    - tir -h indents the text under the headings as in a man page
    - Take the version from the Version line of tir; gmake release
      takes no argument
    - Stop at once under a make older than 3.82, which has no .ONESHELL
    - Put the full date in the man page, and write the author URL bare,
      so that mandoc -Tlint gives no warning

v0.10 2026-10-28
    - Embed the manual in tir as Markdown; -h shows its NAME, SYNOPSIS
      and VERSION, so the usage is written only once
    - Generate tir.md and tir.1 from the embedded manual
    - Rewrite README.md for the repository, with Homebrew installation
    - Add the copyright to the manual, and write tir.1 in ASCII so that
      nroff shows the copyright sign
    - Update goodnews format
    - Write define() with IFS= read -rd ''

v0.9 2026-03-01
    - Add Makefile for release management
    - Add Changes file
    - Fix countdown interval description
    - Generate tir.1 from README.md via pandoc with Lua filter
    - Add -h option to documentation
    - Note Japanese blog links in SEE ALSO
    - Include Changes diff in release commit message
    - Suppress noisy output in release process

v0.8 2026-03-01
    - Add man page and MIT license

v0.7 2025-07-25
    - Update documentation to match current implementation
    - Change default voice from Alex to Fred
